},{"name":"關稅/貿易","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-13","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/18230/000001823026000008/cat-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Originally organized as Caterpillar Tractor Co. in 1925 in the State of California, our company was reorganized as Caterpillar Inc. in 1986 in the State of Delaware. As used herein, the term \"Caterpillar,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our\" or \"the company\" refers to Caterpillar Inc. and its subsidiaries unless designated or identified otherwise.","zh":"我們公司最初於 1925 年在加州組成 Caterpillar Tractor Co.，後來於 1986 年在特拉華州重組為 Caterpillar Inc.。如本文所用，術語「Caterpillar」、「我們」、「我們的」或「公司」是指 Caterpillar Inc. 及其子公司，除非另有指定或標識。"},{"en":"With 2025 sales and revenues of $67.589 billion, Caterpillar Inc. is shaping the future as the world's leading manufacturer of construction and mining equipment, off-highway diesel and natural gas engines, industrial gas turbines and diesel-electric locomotives. Backed by one of the largest independent global dealer networks and financing services through Cat Financial, the company's primary business segments: Power & Energy, Construction Industries and Resource Industries are solving customers' toughest challenges through commercial excellence and advanced technology, driven by a highly skilled, dedicated global team.","zh":"卡特彼勒 (Caterpillar Inc.) 到 2025 年的銷售額和收入將達到 675.89 億美元，正在塑造未來，成為全球領先的建築和採礦設備、非公路柴油和天然氣發動機、工業燃氣渦輪機和柴電機車製造商。在全球最大的獨立經銷商網路之一和 Cat Financial 提供的融資服務的支持下，該公司的主要業務部門：電力與能源、建築業和資源行業，在高技能、敬業的全球團隊的推動下，透過卓越的商業和先進技術解決客戶最棘手的挑戰。"},{"en":"In 2025, our company introduced a revised strategy anchored by a new mission statement: Solving our customers' toughest challenges. Coupled with our purpose, we build a better, more sustainable world, this strategy guides how we operate with our global team and engage with customers, dealers and suppliers. The refreshed strategy establishes three profitable growth pillars focused on addressing customers' needs; Commercial Excellence, Advanced Technology Leader, and Transform How We Work. These pillars are built upon our longstanding foundation of Operational Excellence and guided by the Operating & Execution model. We also re-enforced our commitment to our Values in Action - Safety, Integrity, Teamwork, Excellence and Commitment. Caterpillar continues to operate through five operating segments, four of which are reportable segments and are described below.","zh":"2025 年，我們公司推出了修訂後的策略，以新的使命宣言為基礎：解決客戶最棘手的挑戰。結合我們的目標，我們建立一個更美好、更永續的世界，該策略指導我們如何與全球團隊合作以及與客戶、經銷商和供應商互動。更新後的策略確立了三大獲利成長支柱，專注於滿足客戶需求；商業卓越，先進技術領導者，改變我們的工作方式。這些支柱建立在我們長期的卓越營運基礎之上，並以營運和執行模型為指導。我們也重申了對行動價值觀的承諾——安全、誠信、團隊合作、卓越和承諾。卡特彼勒繼續透過五個營運部門進行運營，其中四個是可報告部門，如下所述。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Caterpillar products and services are sold worldwide into a variety of highly competitive markets. In all markets, we compete on the basis of product performance, customer service, quality and price. From time to time, the intensity of competition results in price discounting in a particular industry or region. Such price discounting puts pressure on margins and can negatively impact operating profit. Outside the United States, certain competitors enjoy competitive advantages inherent to operating in their home countries or regions.","zh":"卡特彼勒的產品和服務銷往全球各個競爭激烈的市場。在所有市場中，我們以產品性能、客戶服務、品質和價格為基礎進行競爭。有時，競爭的激烈程度會導致特定行業或地區的價格折扣。這種價格折扣會對利潤率造成壓力，並對營業利潤產生負面影響。在美國以外，某些競爭對手享有在其本國或地區營運所固有的競爭優勢。"},{"en":"We source our raw materials and manufactured components from suppliers both domestically and internationally. These purchases include unformed materials and rough and finished parts. Unformed materials include a variety of steel products, which are then cut or formed to shape and machined in our facilities. Rough parts include various sized steel and iron castings and forgings, which are machined to final specification levels inside our facilities. Finished parts are ready to assemble components, which are made either to Caterpillar specifications or to supplier developed specifications. We machine and assemble some of the components used in our machines, engines and power generation units and to support our after-market dealer parts sales. We also purchase various goods and services used in production, logistics, offices and product development processes. We maintain global strategic so","zh":"我們從國內和國際供應商採購原料和製造零件。這些採購包括未成型材料以及毛坯件和成品件。未成型材料包括各種鋼材產品，然後在我們的設施中切割或成型以成型和機械加工。毛坯件包括各種尺寸的鋼、鐵鑄件和鍛件，它們在我們的工廠內加工至最終規格等級。成品零件已準備好組裝組件，這些組件是按照 Caterpillar 規格或供應商開發的規格製造的。我們加工和組裝我們的機器、引擎和發電機組中使用的一些零件，並支援我們的售後經銷商零件銷售。我們也購買用於生產、物流、辦公室和產品開發過程的各種商品和服務。我們保持全球戰略"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Reportable Segment Aggregation Before Other Operating","val":73955000000,"zh":"其他經營分部之前的可報告分部總結"},{"name":"Power Energy","val":32201000000,"zh":"電力能源"},{"name":"Construction Industries","val":25060000000,"zh":"建築業"},{"name":"Resource Industries","val":12474000000,"zh":"資源產業"},{"name":"Financial Products","val":4220000000,"zh":"金融商品部門"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":327000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":67589000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Machinery Power Energy","val":63980000000,"zh":"機械動力能源"},{"name":"Financial Products","val":3609000000,"zh":"金融商品"}],"total":67589000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":36609000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"Non Us","val":34709000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"US","val":32880000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":12793000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":11199000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":6988000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"}],"total":67589000000}},"peers":["DE","MMM","JNJ","CVX","PG"]}}